# Keeps these real-tool lockfile fixtures (2026-09-26-lockfile-corroboration)
# out of Sniff's own repository walks. Without it, `sniff repo` on this monorepo
# reports every fixture as a nested workspace layer, because the nested-marker
# walk has no fixture-directory exclusion. `ignore`-crate walkers (Sniff, rg,
# fd) honor this file; git does not, so every fixture stays tracked. Tests copy
# a fixture into a temporary directory before detecting it.
/*/
